Local Audio Zones

This community app is based on Music Assistant Local Audio and its native
Sendspin player update in pull request 34:
https://github.com/music-assistant/local-audio-addon
https://github.com/music-assistant/local-audio-addon/pull/34

The packaging and startup code have been modified to provide independent room
players, native room configuration, validated channel routing, durable route
ownership, and separate supervision and saved state. The original Apache-2.0
license is retained in LICENSE.

The image builds sendspin-cpp-cli v0.2.0, commit
e980128a9c37229cbc28c764e9f2fd65d1c5edb6, and its sendspin-cpp dependency.
Copyright 2026 sendspin-cpp-cli Contributors.
These projects use the Apache License, Version 2.0. The documented local patch
pins named PulseAudio outputs using PA_STREAM_DONT_MOVE.
https://github.com/Sendspin/sendspin-cpp-cli
https://github.com/Sendspin/sendspin-cpp

The icon adapts the HASSConnect house artwork with room speaker symbols.
